      "writtenOn": "2020-08-04T17:04:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Two questions:\n1. Is precharge current the correct one to use here?  That\u0027s typically 256 mA \n2. This equation differs between the slide deck given and the most recent datasheet we have.  It\u0027s either 50 mA + (IBAT_EOC_TH  * 100mA) or 50mA * (IBAT_EOC_TH + 100 mA).  I would guess the first would make the most sense given the units on the second would be mA^2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 911,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 912,
        "endChar": 19
      },
      "revId": "9c01e413dfb6869c0fd5822a690a2686d0576d9e",
